From: Emmanuellsensai <86744981+Emmanuellsensai@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:24:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix CI: renumber migrations, partitioned index, v2 route
 list, Python client, prettier

- Renumber the PR migrations 000052-000055 to 000053-000056 after merging
  main, which already has 000052_api_key_restrictions.
- 000054: CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY is not allowed on the partitioned events
  parent; use a plain CREATE INDEX (same as 000020/000023/000046), with a
  migration lint allowlist entry. Fix the down migration the same way.
- List the new v1-only routes in the v2 not-ported set.
- Regenerate the Python client with openapi-python-client 0.29.1 on Python 3.12.
- Run prettier on the deliveries page.
